+## Canonical prepared receipts and qualification limits
+
+Prepared application uses the canonical `createSfPreparedApply` producer. A receipt is accepted only when its C08 transaction witnesses `cases` and `receipts` together with the declared `domainSurface`. The domain effect and its prepared receipt belong to that same transaction; WP11's earlier durable application reservation retains the original case, change, human choice and review binding before dispatch. The controlled fixtures read this producer's proof; they do not construct or repair a `scopeDigest`.
